    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505231,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depend on the agricultural season and on how \nyour government will react. They may decide to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510911,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "subsidize food prices. So which countries are the \nmost vulnerable? We don't know fully, but just to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517551,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get an idea, according to the UN, some of the most \nvulnerable nations right now are those where the  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523311,
    "dDurationMs": 9840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seasonal timing is very bad. Like in particularly \nSri Lanka where the Maha rice harvest is underway.  "
    } ]
  }, {
